<title>USA: CellStar says board oks 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>CellStar says board oks 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CellStar Corp said Tuesday that its board had approved a three-for-two common stock split.</p>
<p>The company said the split would be paid in the form of a stock dividend and be distributed June 17 to stockholders of record June 2.</p>
<p>The company, an integrated wholesaler and retailer of wireless communications products, said the split will increase its outstanding shares to about 28.9 million from about 19.3 million.</p>
</text>
